{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter[[cite:obs-f873e2806e1e18a0b23cfb2e2c77f923e19a5ec3 \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]].\n\nAccording to the annex, the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January[[cite:obs-afe418e50949d8d45a19b8e2ca648ce84645d131 \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added statements about the membership fee and yearly amount paid by members with exact citations from the charter and annex sources as requested."}